# Runtime-mutable/shared state: patches are written by the backend admin panel and
# applied live via the mounted DATA_PATH volume, not something a fresh image build
# should bake in. The rest of data/ (chunks + qlever index files) is intentionally
# NOT excluded — the production image is built with pre-fetched/indexed data already
# in place ("baked-in data", see README.md's Docker entrypoint section).
data/patches/
